               <ul><li>SRPCM – Composite scale<br></li><li>SRPS1 – Physical science scale<br></li><li>SRPS2 – Earth science scale<br></li><li>SRPS3 – Life science scale<br></li><li>Science 2005R3<br></li><li>SRPUV – Overall science scale<br></li></ul></li><li>TEL 
