               <a href="/nrcdataservice/GetAdhocData.aspx?type=gaponvaracrossjuris&amp;subject=mathematics&amp;grade=8&amp;subscale=MRPCM&amp;variable=GENDER&amp;jurisdiction=NP%2cCA%2cCO%2cNJ%2cPA%2cNV&amp;stattype=MN%3aMN&amp;Year=2015%2c2013&amp;RevealDataKeys=true">https://www.nationsreportcard.gov/nrcdataservice/GetAdhocData.aspx?type=gaponvaracrossjuris&amp;subject=mathematics&amp;grade=8&amp;subscale=MRPCM&amp;variable=GENDER&amp;jurisdiction=NP,CA,CO,NJ,PA,NV&amp;stattype=MN%3AMN&amp;Year=2015,2013&amp;RevealDataKeys=true</a></li></ul><h3 class="nrc-rteElement-h3"> ShowDetails (Show&#160;Standard Errors)<br></h3></div><div><div></div><div><div>The API can return additional statistical details for data queries when the optional parameter 'QCData=true' is included.</div>
